/* intimate wipes, shared by glow and siku; n = wipes a month */
const IWIPE=(g,n,why,whySw)=>({k:'iwipe',g,n:['Intimate wipes, individually wrapped','Vitambaa maji vya sehemu za siri, kila kimoja kimefungwa'],f:'m',q:[n+' wipes a month',n===1?'kitambaa 1 kwa mwezi':'vitambaa '+n+' kwa mwezi'],src:['nhsvag','nhsper'],
 exp:['Pads should be changed every 3–4 hours, and at work, on a dala-dala journey or in a public toilet there is often no clean water to freshen up at the change. A pH-balanced, alcohol-free intimate wipe, used once on the outer skin only and then discarded, lets her change in comfort and stay fresh until she can wash properly. '+why+' The wipes are individually wrapped, so one sits discreetly in a handbag or pocket. They complement the daily wash and never replace it; anything used inside the vagina, douches and strongly perfumed sprays are deliberately excluded, because they upset the protective bacteria and irritate the skin (NHS). Comfort and Luxury both carry Femfresh, the leading pharmacy intimate wipe; we found no more premium individually wrapped wipe on sale in Tanzania or Kenya.',
  'Pedi zinapaswa kubadilishwa kila saa 3–4, na kazini, safarini kwa daladala au kwenye choo cha umma mara nyingi hakuna maji safi ya kujisafisha wakati wa kubadilisha. Kitambaa maji cha sehemu za siri chenye pH sawia na kisicho na alkoholi, kinachotumika mara moja kwenye ngozi ya nje tu kisha kutupwa, humwezesha kubadilisha kwa faraja na kubaki safi hadi atakapoweza kuoga vizuri. '+whySw+' Kila kitambaa kimefungwa peke yake, hivyo kimoja hukaa kimya kimya kwenye mkoba au mfukoni. Vitambaa hivi vinaongeza usafi wa kila siku na haviuchukui nafasi yake; chochote cha kutumia ndani ya uke, dawa za kusafisha ndani na marashi yenye manukato makali vimeachwa kwa makusudi, kwa sababu huvuruga bakteria walinzi na kuwasha ngozi (NHS). Comfort na Luxury zote zina Femfresh, kitambaa maji kinachoongoza katika famasi; hatukupata kitambaa cha hadhi ya juu zaidi kinachouzwa Tanzania au Kenya.'],
 o:{E:[S('iw_dad',n),S('iw_ffw',n)],C:[S('iw_ffw',n),S('iw_dad',n)],L:[S('iw_ffw',n),S('iw_dad',n)]}});

