 key:'presha',
 name:['High blood pressure','Presha (shinikizo la damu)'],
 tagline:['Measure at home, cook with less salt, and keep every dose on time.','Pima nyumbani, pika kwa chumvi kidogo, na meza kila dozi kwa wakati.'],
 lede:['High blood pressure rarely causes symptoms, so the only way to know it is controlled is to measure it. The first box is the larger one, because it carries a validated upper-arm monitor, a logbook and a pill organiser that last for years; after that, each month brings the oats, unsalted nuts, salt-free flavourings and care items that make a low-salt, heart-healthy routine easier, with a free blood pressure and monitor check in store every month and the yearly kidney, heart and sugar checks planned for you. The box contains no medicine and does not replace your clinic: it keeps you measuring and on track between visits.',
  'Presha mara chache huonyesha dalili, hivyo njia pekee ya kujua kama imedhibitiwa ni kuipima. Sanduku la kwanza ndilo kubwa zaidi, kwa sababu linaleta kipimo cha mkono kilichothibitishwa, daftari la kumbukumbu na kisanduku cha dawa vinavyodumu kwa miaka; baada ya hapo, kila mwezi huleta shayiri, karanga zisizo na chumvi, viungo visivyo na chumvi na vifaa vya huduma vinavyorahisisha maisha yenye chumvi kidogo na afya ya moyo, pamoja na ukaguzi wa bure wa presha na wa kipimo chako dukani kila mwezi na vipimo vya kila mwaka vya figo, moyo na sukari vilivyopangwa kwa ajili yako. Sanduku halina dawa na halichukui nafasi ya kliniki yako: linakusaidia kuendelea kupima na kufuata mpango kati ya ziara.'],
