 lede:['A monthly safety and hygiene supply for every 25 staff: two first-aid boxes kept full, soap, sanitiser, toilet and cleaning stock sized to the headcount, and desk disinfectant for shared surfaces, with the first-aid record and an annual welfare report ready for an OSH inspector. Larger sites simply add blocks.',
  'Mahitaji ya kila mwezi ya usalama na usafi kwa kila wafanyakazi 25: masanduku mawili ya huduma ya kwanza yaliyojaa, sabuni, kitakasa, vifaa vya choo na usafi kulingana na idadi ya watu, pamoja na dawa ya kusafisha meza kwa sehemu za pamoja, daftari la huduma ya kwanza na ripoti ya ustawi ya kila mwaka vikiwa tayari kwa mkaguzi wa OSH. Maeneo makubwa huongeza vitalu tu.'],
 stageWord:['Size','Ukubwa'],
 boxes:[{k:'kit',n:['The monthly kit','Kifurushi cha mwezi'],g:['safety','hygiene','sector','staff']}],
