   note:['Warm finger-millet uji is a traditional drink for new mothers across East Africa, and it is a sound choice: it adds fluid, energy and calcium at a time when a breastfeeding mother needs more of all three. Cooking it with milk adds protein and more calcium. Uji does not itself increase milk supply; frequent, effective breastfeeding does, so drink to thirst and feed on demand.',
    'Uji wa ulezi wa moto ni kinywaji cha jadi kwa wazazi wapya kote Afrika Mashariki, na ni chaguo zuri: unaongeza maji mwilini, nishati na kalsiamu wakati ambapo mama anayenyonyesha anahitaji zaidi ya vyote vitatu. Kuupika kwa maziwa huongeza protini na kalsiamu zaidi. Uji wenyewe hauongezi maziwa ya mama; kunyonyesha mara kwa mara na kwa ufanisi ndiko kunakoongeza, hivyo kunywa kadiri unavyohisi kiu na nyonyesha kila mtoto anapohitaji.'],
