const T_N=['One tied bag a day keeps used nappies sealed until the bin is collected.','Mfuko mmoja uliofungwa kwa siku huhifadhi nepi zilizotumika hadi taka zichukuliwe.'];
const X={
 nappy:n=>['A used nappy is human faeces wrapped in plastic. Less than 40% of Dar es Salaam’s rubbish is formally collected, and nappies left on open ground, in drains or in the river spread the germs behind childhood diarrhoea and worms, block storm drains and add to flooding; a study across Ghana, Kenya and Nigeria found more than half of all disposable nappies end up in homes with no safe disposal. The safe routine is simple: tip any solid poo into the toilet, roll the nappy closed, keep the day’s nappies in one bag, tie it shut and put it in a lidded bin for collection. One bag a day is '+n+' bags a month. Never burn or bury nappies: they do not burn cleanly on a home fire and animals dig them up. The bags are priced into the box at the shelf price, like every other item.',
  'Nepi iliyotumika ni kinyesi cha binadamu kilichofungwa kwenye plastiki. Chini ya asilimia 40 ya taka za Dar es Salaam hukusanywa rasmi, na nepi zinazotupwa kwenye viwanja wazi, mitaro au mtoni hueneza vijidudu vya kuharisha na minyoo kwa watoto, huziba mitaro ya maji ya mvua na kuchangia mafuriko; utafiti uliofanyika Ghana, Kenya na Nigeria ulikuta zaidi ya nusu ya nepi zote zinatumika katika kaya zisizo na njia salama ya kuzitupa. Utaratibu salama ni rahisi: mwaga kinyesi kigumu chooni, kunja nepi ifunge, weka nepi za siku nzima kwenye mfuko mmoja, ufunge na uweke kwenye pipa lenye mfuniko hadi zichukuliwe. Mfuko mmoja kwa siku ni mifuko '+n+' kwa mwezi. Usichome wala kufukia nepi: haziungui vizuri kwenye moto wa nyumbani na wanyama huzifukua. Mifuko imewekwa kwenye bei ya sanduku kwa bei ya rafu, kama bidhaa nyingine zote.'],
 pad:n=>['A used pad should never be flushed or thrown in the open: it blocks toilets and drains, and less than 40% of the city’s rubbish is formally collected, so a pad dropped outside stays there. Wrap each used pad in its wrapper or a tissue, keep the day’s pads in one small bag, tie it shut and put it in a lidded bin. About five bleeding days and one spare make '+n+' bags a cycle. The bags are priced into the box at the shelf price.',
  'Pedi iliyotumika haipaswi kuflashiwa chooni wala kutupwa nje: huziba vyoo na mitaro, na chini ya asilimia 40 ya taka za jiji hukusanywa rasmi, hivyo pedi iliyotupwa nje hubaki pale pale. Funga kila pedi iliyotumika kwenye kifungashio chake au tishu, weka pedi za siku kwenye mfuko mmoja mdogo, ufunge na uweke kwenye pipa lenye mfuniko. Takriban siku tano za damu na mfuko mmoja wa ziada ni mifuko '+n+' kwa mzunguko. Mifuko imewekwa kwenye bei ya sanduku kwa bei ya rafu.'],
 adult:(n,why)=>['Bladder-leak pads, adult briefs and bed underpads are heavy, wet waste. Sealed in a tied bag they keep the smell in the bin, protect the carer and the waste collector, and stay out of drains, where less than 40% of the city’s rubbish is formally collected. '+why[0]+' The bags are priced into the box at the shelf price.',
  'Pedi za kuvuja kwa mkojo, nepi za watu wazima na tandiko za kitanda ni taka nzito na zenye unyevu. Zikifungwa kwenye mfuko hubakiza harufu ndani ya pipa, humlinda mlezi na mkusanyaji wa taka, na hazifiki mitaroni, kwa kuwa chini ya asilimia 40 ya taka za jiji hukusanywa rasmi. '+why[1]+' Mifuko imewekwa kwenye bei ya sanduku kwa bei ya rafu.']};
