ins('mama','a','diap',{k:'cloth',g:'baby',n:['Washable cloth nappy set · 8 covers + 24 cotton inserts','Seti ya nepi za kitambaa · vifuniko 8 + vitambaa 24'],f:'o',q:['One set, used for the first year','Seti moja, inatumika mwaka wa kwanza'],src:['diapwaste','gainsmall'],
 exp:['A newborn needs about 10 changes a day. With 24 cotton inserts and 8 waterproof covers, a mother washes once a day and always has a dry set ready; the covers are wiped and reused, and only the insert is changed each time. The set costs less than half of one month of disposable nappies and lasts the first year, which is the single biggest saving a family can make. Cloth is used by day at home; a small pack of disposables is kept for nights, clinic visits and travel.','Mtoto mchanga anahitaji kubadilishwa takriban mara 10 kwa siku. Kwa vitambaa 24 vya pamba na vifuniko 8 visivyopitisha maji, mama hufua mara moja kwa siku na daima anakuwa na seti kavu; vifuniko hufutwa na kutumika tena, na ni kitambaa cha ndani tu kinachobadilishwa kila mara. Seti hii inagharimu chini ya nusu ya nepi za kutupa za mwezi mmoja na hudumu mwaka wa kwanza, na hii ndiyo akiba kubwa zaidi ambayo familia inaweza kupata. Kitambaa hutumika mchana nyumbani; pakiti ndogo ya nepi za kutupa huwekwa kwa usiku, safari za kliniki na safari.'],
 o:{M:[[['ms_cloth2',8],['ms_cloth1',24]],[['ms_cloth3',8]]]}});
['a','b','c','d'].forEach(sk=>ins('mama',sk,'laun',{k:'lbar',g:'baby',n:['Laundry bar soap for cloth nappies and baby clothes','Sabuni ya mche ya kufulia nepi za kitambaa na nguo za mtoto'],f:'m',q:['2 bars of 800 g a month','Miche 2 ya gramu 800 kwa mwezi'],src:['gainsmall'],
 exp:['Washing one load of nappies and baby clothes a day uses about 50 g of bar soap, so two 800 g bars cover the month. Bar soap costs a fraction of washing powder, rinses out well, and is what most Dar es Salaam households already wash with. Rinse soiled inserts first, wash in hot soapy water and dry in full sun, which helps kill germs.','Kufua nepi na nguo za mtoto mara moja kwa siku hutumia takriban gramu 50 za sabuni ya mche, hivyo miche miwili ya gramu 800 inatosha mwezi. Sabuni ya mche ni nafuu sana kuliko sabuni ya unga, husuuzika vizuri, na ndiyo kaya nyingi za Dar es Salaam tayari hufulia. Suuza kwanza vitambaa vichafu, fua kwa maji ya moto yenye sabuni na anika juani, jambo linalosaidia kuua vijidudu.'],
 o:{M:[[['ms_lbar2',2]],[['ms_lbar3',2]],[['ms_lbar1',9]]]}}));
const RPAD=g=>({k:'rpad',g,n:['Washable reusable pads · 4 pads','Pedi za kufua zinazotumika tena · pedi 4'],f:'o',q:['4 pads, used for years','Pedi 4, zinatumika kwa miaka'],src:['wbpads'],
 exp:['The World Bank estimates disposable pads cost a Tanzanian woman about TSh 3,500 a month, a cost that keeps many girls home from school. Four washable cotton pads, worn in turn, washed with soap and dried in full sun, last for years. A small pack of disposables stays in the box for school days and nights away, so she is never caught short. The pads pay for themselves in under a year.','Benki ya Dunia inakadiria pedi za kutupa zinamgharimu mwanamke wa Tanzania takriban TSh 3,500 kwa mwezi, gharama inayowafanya wasichana wengi kubaki nyumbani wasiende shule. Pedi nne za pamba za kufua, zikivaliwa kwa zamu, kufuliwa kwa sabuni na kuanikwa juani, hudumu kwa miaka. Pakiti ndogo ya pedi za kutupa inabaki kwenye sanduku kwa siku za shule na usiku nje ya nyumbani, ili asikose kamwe. Pedi hizi zinarudisha gharama yake chini ya mwaka mmoja.'],
 o:{M:[[['ms_rpad1',4]],[['ms_rpad2',3]]]}});
