 carelead:['The box keeps the household supplied; the care plan keeps it checked. Each service is timed to the stage of life, with who provides it, what the member pays and why it matters.','Sanduku linahakikisha nyumba haikosi mahitaji; mpango wa huduma unahakikisha inafanyiwa uchunguzi. Kila huduma imepangwa kulingana na hatua ya maisha, ikionyesha nani anaitoa, mwanachama analipa kiasi gani na kwa nini ni muhimu.'],
